        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Cashier forecasts weekly denomination demand (coins, PHP 20/50/100 notes) based on transaction pattern and seasonality (paydays increase small-note demand)
Responsible (R): Cashier
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Weekly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2805_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2805_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
