Responsible (R): CIT Operations
Accountable (A): CIT Operations Manager
Duration: Weekly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2805_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2805_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2805_Task8" name="Store Manager validates delivered change count under dual-control; updates…">
