      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Continuous; reviewed at cash-office close
Frequency: Daily + monthly audit
Volume: 200 cash offices
Owner: Store Manager
Participants: Store Manager, LP, Internal Audit
Source: workflow W2807 — Cash Office Security, Dual-Control &amp; CCTV Correlation</bpmn:documentation>
