Responsible (R): LP
Accountable (A): LP Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2807_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2807_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
