Responsible (R): Cashier
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2808_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2808_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
